# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase (OPTIONAL) — enables two features when set:
#   1. Live sync: participant/audience devices follow the game master in real
#      time (Realtime broadcast, no tables needed).
#   2. Cloud save: an account's parties and games are backed up and sync across
#      devices (requires running supabase/schema.sql once — see README).
#
# The app is fully functional offline without any of these.
#
# Create a free Supabase project (https://supabase.com), then copy the project
# URL and the public anon key from Project Settings -> API.
#
# These are exposed to the browser (NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) — the anon key is safe
# to expose; do NOT put a service_role key here.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
